          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove Account?" : {
      "comment" : "Asks before removing an account",
      "localizations" : {
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "להסיר את החשבון?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the settings screen",
      "localizations" : {
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "הגדרות"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shown to the people you write to from %@." : {
      "comment" : "Explains an account's sender name",
      "localizations" : {
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "מוצג לנמענים של הודעות מ-%@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Something Went Wrong" : {
      "comment" : "Title of a settings failure alert",
      "localizations" : {
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "משהו השתבש"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sorts the Inbox into Primary, Promotions, Social, Updates and Forums, as Gmail does." : {
      "comment" : "Explains the Inbox Categories setting",
      "localizations" : {
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ממיין את הדואר הנכנס לראשי, קידומי מכירות, רשתות חברתיות, עדכונים ופורומים, כמו ב-Gmail."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme" : {
      "comment" : "Settings section for the color of views showing every account",
      "localizations" : {
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ערכת נושא"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo Send" : {
      "comment" : "Setting for how long a sent message can be taken back",
      "localizations" : {
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ביטול שליחה"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo Send: Off" : {
      "comment" : "Undo Send is turned off",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off"
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "כבוי"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Views that show every account, like the unified inbox, wear a gradient of your account colors. Turn it off to choose one color." : {
      "comment" : "Explains the Gradient setting",
      "localizations" : {
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "תצוגות שמציגות את כל החשבונות, כמו תיבת הדואר המאוחדת, נצבעות במעבר בין צבעי החשבונות שלך. אפשר לכבות זאת ולבחור צבע אחד."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without avatars, a dot beside a row still marks unread mail." : {
      "comment" : "Explains turning avatars off",
      "localizations" : {
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "גם בלי תמונות פרופיל, נקודה ליד שורה מסמנת דואר שלא נקרא."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Name" : {
      "comment" : "Placeholder for an account's sender name",
      "localizations" : {
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "השם שלך"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}
